# M17 armour, second pass (docs/CLIENT_RENDERING.md §18): the inventory window's 3D figure. A new Aydor warrior is
# dressed (cosmetic `scene wear` / `wield`, never sent) in the Korlu heavy set with the Kor sword, the inventory is
# opened and its figure must show the model with all five pieces. Run at 1280x720, 1920x1080 and 1024x640 with
# ui_scale 1.5. Screenshots: docs/screenshots/m17_art/inv_figure_<size>.png.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m17_figure
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Vitrin
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded 1800
waitfor world+nobanner 400
scene wear 130 131 132 133 134
scene wield 62 0
wait 45
scene expectlocalarmor 5
clickon world.inventory
waitfor world+inv 30
wait 20
scene expectinvfigure 5
screenshot inv_figure.png
key escape
waitfor world+invclosed 30
quit
